# What may enter the build of deploy/api/Dockerfile.
#
# Everything is left out, and then only what the image is built from is let in.
# A new folder, a settings file or a secret left in the checkout stays out
# without anyone having to remember it.
#
# Docker reads this file because it sits beside the Dockerfile and carries its
# name. Fly.io is told where it is with `--ignorefile`.

*

!packages/core/pyproject.toml
!packages/core/src
!services/api/pyproject.toml
!services/api/src
!data/fixtures/synthetic

# A release folder holds its files and nothing else, so nothing a file browser
# or an interpreter leaves behind may come with it.
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.DS_Store
